MODULE: RefreshResetsDebt
TARGET: RefreshPreservesDebt
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a same-parameter refresh mints another burst
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
          /\ tat' = [tat EXCEPT ![s] = IF install /\ ~same THEN 0 ELSE @]
--- REPLACE
          /\ tat' = [tat EXCEPT ![s] = IF install THEN 0 ELSE @]
--- END
